        "quote": "Advanced malware development is\nbeyond the current capabilities of available LLMs, and even an advanced LLM paired with an expert malware"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Instruction fine-tuning that prioritizes safety can degrade coding performance if run too long; the authors stopped at a balance of coding and safety.", "tone": "mixed",
      "source": {
